{
  "id": "liar",
  "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
  "rate": "+0%",
  "title": "Spot the liar: which suspect is lying?",
  "hot": ["lying", "liar", "myths", "away", "fidgeting", "neither", "say", "check", "name", "receipt", "camera", "vague", "backwards", "rewind", "b", "apart", "sweaty", "truth", "nerves", "lies", "200", "fifty-four", "coin", "flip"],
  "lines": [
    {"text": "One of these three is lying about last night. Learn what detectives really look for, then you find the liar.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "SPOT THE LIAR", "note": "",
      "events": [{"cue": "lying", "kind": "lying"}, {"cue": "Learn", "kind": "wipe"}]},
    {"text": "First, the myths. Looking away? Fidgeting? Neither one means lying.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "MYTHS", "note": "",
      "events": [{"cue": "myths", "kind": "myths"}, {"cue": "away", "kind": "gaze"}, {"cue": "Fidgeting", "kind": "fidget"}, {"cue": "Neither", "kind": "myth"}]},
    {"text": "What works better is what they say.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "REAL SIGNS", "note": "", "pause": 0.2,
      "events": [{"cue": "say", "kind": "say"}]},
    {"text": "Truth tellers give details you can check. A name, a receipt, a camera.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "1 · CHECKABLE", "note": "", "pause": 0.1,
      "events": [{"cue": "check", "kind": "check"}, {"cue": "name", "kind": "name"}, {"cue": "receipt", "kind": "receipt"}, {"cue": "camera", "kind": "camera"}]},
    {"text": "Liars keep it vague.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "1 · CHECKABLE", "note": "", "pause": 0.15,
      "events": [{"cue": "vague", "kind": "vague"}]},
    {"text": "And ask for the story backwards. A lie is harder to rewind.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "2 · BACKWARDS", "note": "", "pause": 0.2,
      "events": [{"cue": "backwards", "kind": "back"}, {"cue": "rewind", "kind": "rewind"}]},
    {"text": "Your turn. Who's lying?", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "YOUR TURN", "note": "", "pause": 0.3,
      "events": [{"cue": "turn", "kind": "test"}, {"cue": "lying", "kind": "ask"}]},
    {"text": "B! Nothing anyone could check, and backwards, it fell apart.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE ANSWER", "note": "", "pause": 8.0,
      "events": [{"cue": "B", "kind": "answer"}, {"cue": "check", "kind": "nocheck"}, {"cue": "apart", "kind": "apart"}]},
    {"text": "And the sweaty, fidgety one? Telling the truth.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE TWIST", "note": "", "pause": 0.25,
      "events": [{"cue": "sweaty", "kind": "a"}, {"cue": "truth", "kind": "truth"}]},
    {"text": "Nerves aren't lies.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "THE TWIST", "note": "", "pause": 0.15,
      "events": [{"cue": "Nerves", "kind": "nerves"}]},
    {"text": "In over 200 studies, people caught liars fifty-four percent of the time.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "REAL LIFE", "note": "", "pause": 0.3,
      "events": [{"cue": "200", "kind": "studies"}, {"cue": "fifty-four", "kind": "pct"}]},
    {"text": "Basically a coin flip.", "scene": "lineup", "chapter": "REAL LIFE", "note": "", "pause": 0.2,
      "events": [{"cue": "coin", "kind": "coin"}]}
  ]
}
